              <button class="accordion-header" data-key="defined-persona">Defined Persona</button>

              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-inner">
                  Portraits that keep the dog recognizable but add interpretation. Clothing, pose or stylization introduces character without replacing the dog itself. Chosen when likeness matters but personality matters more.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
              <button class="accordion-header" data-key="grand-scene">Grand Scene</button>

              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-inner">
                  Portraits where the dog becomes part of a setting. Furniture, interior and composition create atmosphere and narrative. Selected when the image should behave like a decorative artwork and shape the space it hangs in.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
        
    </div>

    {% if section.settings.button_text != blank %}
      <div class="portrait-styles__button">
        <a href="{{ section.settings.button_link }}" class="button">
          {{ section.settings.button_text }}
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
    
